    "breadcrumb": "FAU Cyber Security Club \u003e Compete",
    "content": "CTFs (Capture the Flag) are structured hacking challenges. You find a hidden string called a flag by exploiting a vulnerability or solving a puzzle.\nThey are the best low-stakes way to practice. This section covers where to start, how to approach challenges, and what categories exist.",
    "description": "What CTFs are, where to start, and how to approach a challenge.",
